{"id":"c734fd84d61635bc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/724_ALCO.md","title":"724 ALCO","display":"724_ALCO","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"724-ALCO\">724 ALCO</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_I\">\\(N_I\\)</span> 是个体名集合，三者两两不交。</p>\n<p>ALCO 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{nom},\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{nom},\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{nom}:N_I\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{nom}:N_I\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>名词构造子显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{a\\}=\\operatorname{nom}(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{a\\}=\\operatorname{nom}(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in N_I\">\\(a\\in N_I\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\operatorname{nom}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R\\cup N_I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R\\cup N_I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\{a\\})=\\{a\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\{a\\})=\\{a\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R,N_I\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R,N_I\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\quad\n\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R,\n\\quad\n\\theta_I:N_I\\to N_I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\quad\n\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R,\n\\quad\n\\theta_I:N_I\\to N_I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\{a\\})=\\{\\theta_I(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\{a\\})=\\{\\theta_I(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 与名词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a\\}\">\\(\\{a\\}\\)</span> 都不是变量绑定构造子；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{O}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{O}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。基础布尔包含公理族定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>名词专属公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{O}\n=\n\\{\\{a\\}\\sqsubseteq\\{a\\}:a\\in N_I\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\{a\\}\\sqcap\\neg\\{a\\}\\sqsubseteq\\bot:a\\in N_I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{O}\n=\n\\{\\{a\\}\\sqsubseteq\\{a\\}:a\\in N_I\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\{a\\}\\sqcap\\neg\\{a\\}\\sqsubseteq\\bot:a\\in N_I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALCO 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<p>以下第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 个条件逐一、分别定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\">\\(L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq\\ell\\leq 7\">\\(1\\leq\\ell\\leq 7\\)</span>）；每行至少满足其中一个条件。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可的唯一组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{7} L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{7} L_\\ell(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节的证明条件是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,i)\\)</span>；本节定义的证明对象、证明谓词及可导出关系均采用此条件。序列须非空、有限且逐行有型；末项条件和各分支的严格早索引条件同时保留。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足上述七类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>概念断言与角色断言为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\\{(a,C):a\\in N_I,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\\{(a,C):a\\in N_I,\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\\{(a,R,b):a,b\\in N_I,\\ R\\in N_R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\\{(a,R,b):a,b\\in N_I,\\ R\\in N_R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\n\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal A\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\n\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathcal A\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R,\\iota_I)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R,\\iota_I)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_I:N_I\\to\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_I:N_I\\to\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(⟦-⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n⟦\\{a\\}⟧=\\{\\iota_I(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\top⟧=\\Delta,\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦ A⟧=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n⟦\\{a\\}⟧=\\{\\iota_I(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg C⟧=\\Delta\\setminus⟦ C⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcap D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cap⟦ D⟧,\\quad\n⟦ C\\sqcup D⟧=⟦ C⟧\\cup⟦ D⟧,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\forall R.C⟧=\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\exists R.C⟧=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in⟦ C⟧)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\subseteq\n⟦ D⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C(a)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota_I(a)\\in⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}C(a)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota_I(a)\\in⟦ C⟧_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}R(a,b)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\iota_I(a),\\iota_I(b))\\in\\iota_R(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}R(a,b)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\iota_I(a),\\iota_I(b))\\in\\iota_R(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\mathcal K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}I)\n\\land\n(\\forall J\\in\\mathcal A\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\mathcal K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}I)\n\\land\n(\\forall J\\in\\mathcal A\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\Phi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\mathcal K\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\Phi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\cup\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n(\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\mathcal K\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCO 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{conceptAssertion},\\operatorname{roleAssertion}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{conceptAssertion},\\operatorname{roleAssertion}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{transRole},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求个体名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_I\">\\(N_I\\)</span> 进入名词构造子、ABox 断言、替换和个体解释函数；这是 ALC、ALCI 与 ALCH 中不存在的句法维度。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,N_I,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\mathsf{CA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\mathsf{RA}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R,\\theta_I},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},⟦-⟧^{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCO}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCO}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" 